      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの方も昔は、\r\nそれは勇ましく剣を振っておられたのですよ。",
        "official_en": "He, too, once swung his sword with unmatched skill and bravery.",
        "real_en": "His Majesty used to wield a sword with great courage, too."
      },
