        "jp_sha256": "ebc45c28e0a168b2e20d1ea1a5da82dd03503a18e655085f5d4dbe4a3c7d8572",
        "official_en_sha256": "5b031cd17b0957ce082e14ca9f9171abf5c875810cdf6753bfc7899e20036ee4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いつか、飛空艇部隊が再編されるときに\r\nご一緒させていただけるよう、\r\n日々の鍛錬を続けておきます。",
        "official_en": "I train daily so that I may be deemed worthy to join the airship squadron once it is rebuilt.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
