        "official_en_sha256": "42954d18b3de8fa6753b6a50fefa2b0d65c5a17377a76fd2a191a67e855e641d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それにしても、まさかあのやんちゃな子が\r\nこんな立派な部屋をもらえるまでになるなんてね。",
        "official_en": "Though I must say...I’m astounded to see the mischievous boy I knew has grown into a man worthy of this chamber.",
        "real_en": null
      },
