        "official_en_sha256": "b7d4094110741edef6b95397feea78eb778ba9162ef3f428575bbd96b4674083"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まさか緊急時の脱出口を使う日がくるなんて、\r\n夢にも思いませんでした。",
        "official_en": "I never once dreamed the day would come when we had to use that emergency exit.",
        "real_en": null
