      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "困ったときは協力を惜しみませんぞ。\r\nとはいえ、もちろんお代はいただきます。\r\n商売では両者両得が基本ですからね。",
        "official_en": "I’m happy to serve whenever you need me...though I will, of course, require a fee. We merchants operate off of the idea of quid pro quo, you see.",
        "real_en": "I'll gladly help whenever you're in trouble. Of course, I'll still charge you. Business should benefit both sides, after all."
      },
